# auto-generated by `next dev` when missing (verified in
# node_modules/next/dist/server/lib/generate-agent-files.js): it only ever
# (re)writes the marked block inside AGENTS.md, and writes CLAUDE.md as a
# one-line `@AGENTS.md` stub the single time neither file exists yet -- it
# never rewrites CLAUDE.md again afterwards. CLAUDE.md is meant to carry
# hand-written project memory (subagent docs, conventions) on top of that
# stub and should be tracked; only AGENTS.md is truly regenerated per-clone.
AGENTS.md
